# notebooklm-deep-dive runtime artifacts
output-notebooklm/

# RCA run bundles: field logs, subscriber identifiers and NDA material.
# Must never reach a remote. Committed before any run can be created.
# Exception: .rca/knowledge/playbooks/ is reviewed, engineer-confirmed
# prose containing no customer data (rca-learn checks this before writing
# there) and is meant to be shared — see run-bundle-layout.md. Everything
# else under .rca/, including .rca/knowledge/cases/ and .rca/issues/,
# stays ignored. Git won't apply a "!" re-include inside an already-
# ignored directory unless the intervening directories are re-included
# too, hence the staged unignore below rather than a single "!" line.
.rca/*
!.rca/knowledge
.rca/knowledge/*
!.rca/knowledge/playbooks